If you really need a lookahead of more than one item, you wouldn't use a foreach loop.

```
for ($i = 0; $i < count($superheroes); $i++) {
    // do sth. with $superheroes[$i]
    if (...) {
        for ($j = $i + 1; $j < count($superheroes); $j++) {
            // do sth. with $superheroes[$j]
        }
    }
}

```

